          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 92,
            "text": "theorem localJets (hL : ∀ n, 0 < L n) (W : ℕ → P × Plane → ℝ)\n    (hW : ∀ n k x, x ∈ s.domain → x ∈ cells n k → envelope n ((g n).coordinates k x.2).2 ≤ W n x) :\n    LocalJets s (fun n x => Real.sqrt (s.zeta x) * W n x) α cells\n      (fun n k => (t n).linearData.copySolve (g n) (hL n).le k)"
